 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"3e6fb1b8-4f6a-473b-9f91-4abddbd43405"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
From the centre of a 3 \[Times] 3 grid eight rays leave, two through each \
neighbour, each ending at a corner.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"242163a2-df53-4c55-bf19-a0b233ecbef1"],

